              "code": "static int Sod1(int num)\n{\n    int count = 0;\n    while (num > 0)\n    {\n        num /= 10;\n        count++;\n    }\n    return count;\n}\nstatic int Sod2(int num)\n{\n    int x = Sod1(num);\n    int NewNum = 0;\n    for (int i = 1; i <= x; i++)\n    {\n        NewNum = (num % 10) + NewNum * 10;\n        num /= 10;\n    }\n    return NewNum;\n}\nstatic void Main(string[] args)\n{\n    Console.WriteLine(Sod2(2786));\n}"
